cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset or its code, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
title: FAIR implementation ecosystem for toxicology
abstract: >-
  A curated dataset of the standards, databases, policies and tools used in toxicology, each typed as a FAIR-Enabling Resource or another FAIR Supporting Resource.
  It combines the resources named in the
  ELIXIR Toxicology Community paper on ten years of the FAIR principles with the FAIRsharing Toxicology
  collection, records when each resource was first published, its FAIRsharing type, lifecycle phase,
  sub-domains and relations, and includes the code to curate the dataset and build its dashboard.
authors:
  - given-names: Jente
    family-names: Houweling
  - name: ELIXIR Toxicology Community
version: 0.2.0
license:
